  "description": "This is a long-standing antisemitic conspiracy theory that falsely claims Jewish people secretly control global financial, political, and media institutions. This concept is used to justify hatred and violence against Jewish people by portraying them as a dangerous, manipulative force that must be eliminated. The meme's text implies this by suggesting that Jewish people are 'pretending to be white' and are therefore a threat to the world.",
